        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"58bba6af-b88f-4821-b220-6194739092b3\",\"review_text\":\"Okay app interface... algorithms need to ensure playlist don't repeat same song despite shuffle...plus it's way too large of an app...pls stop asking permission to access my camera and microphone like its 1984\"},{\"review_id\":\"81f394b1-7b26-4fb7-a8fd-42050c5ba6ae\",\"review_text\":\"Bravo!!! Loved it... Almost 10 years after installing Spotify ap in my in my gadgets - - I am still enjoying and loving it. Such a stress reliever to a senior citizen like me 😍\"},{\"review_id\":\"67ba74c8-7f15-4457-9eb9-0a2754cbd325\",\"review_text\":\"Have premium, but no internet even though I can download other apps from the INTERNET! What a joke.... Canceled my subscription.\"},{\"review_id\":\"8a38dea1-0ad1-46bc-8bae-3fbdcda4c176\",\"review_text\":\"Bikki. Kumar Di id ci bu idh Didi tik km Gue dikunci\"},{\"review_id\":\"197f2c4c-0b37-4c46-8762-b45640fe6ccc\",\"review_text\":\"Your new policy is very bed\"},{\"review_id\":\"c8394ae6-4d22-47bd-9cc5-69bd32afafe6\",\"review_text\":\"Really A Good App\"},{\"review_id\":\"787aafe5-24a2-4a59-a7c6-75feac8d48fb\",\"review_text\":\"Excellent app you can listen to music of your own choice. Brilliant idea\"},{\"review_id\":\"d5bd5483-e07e-4550-8b58-57323da828a0\",\"review_text\":\"I like this app 😍\"},{\"review_id\":\"bdc59283-f784-401d-bfa9-f835c7eb603d\",\"review_text\":\"this is free therapy\"},{\"review_id\":\"0772b31a-fe89-4d04-9457-36a57dd4b595\",\"review_text\":\"Plz phle Wale Spotify la do..... Plz ..\"}]}"
